This is the best-in-slot available equipment for fighting nechryaels with Melee. Using a [[demonbane]] weapon is highly recommended. These weapons scale extremely well with strength bonus, so it is strongly recommended to prioritise this over prayer bonus gear where possible.

===Notes===
*[[Seed box]] can be used to collect larger amounts of seeds drops
*[[Cooked karambwan]] or better to heal from damage from [[death spawn]]s
*[[Explorer's ring 4]] or teleport to a bank or bank deposit box for alchable drops
*[[Super restore]]s or [[Prayer potion]]s for use of [[Piety]] and [[Protect from Melee]]
*[[Divine super combat potion]]s or [[Super attack potion|Super attacks]] and [[Divine super strength potion]]s
*Runes for [[Demonic Offering]] for additional Prayer experience; optionally, runes and [[Book of the Dead]] for [[Death Charge]] and [[thrall]]s
